      "title": "SeedVR2 Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SeedVR2 model files\n\n### Repo 1: numz/SeedVR2_comfyUI\nMore info [HERE](https://huggingface.co/numz/SeedVR2_comfyUI/tree/main)\n\n| Model file | Size |\n|---|---:|\n| `ema_vae_fp16.safetensors` | 501 MB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensors` | 6.78 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 3.39 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensors` | 16.5 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 8.24 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp16.safetensors` | 16.5 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 8.24 GB |\n\n### Repo 2: AInVFX/SeedVR2_comfyUI\nMore info [HERE](https://huggingface.co/AInVFX/SeedVR2_comfyUI/tree/main)\n\n| Model file | Size |\n|---|---:|\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 2 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.gguf` | 3.66 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 4.76 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors` | 8.47 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 4.76 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors` | 8.47 GB |\n\n### Notes\n- **fp16**: best quality, uses more VRAM\n- **fp8 (e4m3fn)**: lower VRAM, usually faster, slightly less accurate\n- **sharp**: sharper output variant\n- **GGUF**: quantized format, often smaller and lighter to run\n"
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
